Volume: ~15-20 store audits annually
Owner: Internal Auditor
Participants: Store HR Administrator, Store Manager, HR Compliance Manager
Source: workflow W5270 — Internal Audit of DTS Program Compliance and Policy Adherence</bpmn:documentation>
