    <bpmn:process id="W_W5271" name="W5271. DTS Program Learning and Development Impact Analytics and Cost-Benefit Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Semiannual calendar close
Frequency: Semiannually
Volume: ~2 reports annually
