      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Approved tax audit (W5269)
Frequency: Annually post-tax season
Volume: ~5-8 entity-level tax-savings computations documented annually
Owner: Tax Accountant
Participants: Partner TVI Director, BIR Officer
Source: workflow W5272 — Annual DTS Tax Savings Computation and Assessment Records</bpmn:documentation>
