Responsible (R): Tax Accountant
Accountable (A): Tax Accountant
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5272_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5272_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
